    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Services theme is designed for websites related to electric work, engineering support, repair solutions, and maintenance services. It includes structured layouts for service details, team sections, contact information, testimonials, and project showcases. The design supports clear navigation and responsive functionality across different screen sizes. Built-in customization options allow changes to colors, typography, banners, and page layouts without affecting usability. The theme also supports image galleries, call-to-action sections, and service listing areas suitable for an electrical repairer, mechanic, or electricity services provider. Clean code structure and optimized layouts help maintain consistent performance and accessibility. This electrician theme can also be used for businesses handling installation, inspection, wiring, equipment servicing, and other electrical maintenance-related tasks in a professional format."
    },
